            "text": "Hi team, welcome to the channel for the Cross-Channel Customer Feedback Improvement Pilot. The goal is to design and run a 6-week pilot to better capture and use customer feedback. Let's kick off by confirming the scope. I've started mapping the current process in A1, based on my initial understanding. Please review and let's align on the touchpoints to include.",
