            "msg_id": "M2",
            "speaker_id": 225681,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks for setting this up. For the insurance side, our main touchpoints are the claims hotline and the policy renewal email sequence. Both should be in scope. I've already started looking at how our current complaint codes could map to a new system for T7.",
