            "speaker_id": 37334,
            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "For the cellar, the primary touchpoint is the post-tour feedback form. We need to be careful about timing. The project constraints mention minimal disruption during peak hours. We should only collect feedback during the tasting portion of the tour, not during the main cellar walk-through when machinery is active.",
