            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "T2"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "page_facing_up",
                "count": 3
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M20",
            "speaker_id": 225681,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "Thanks, taking a look now. The categories 'Product Issue', 'Service Quality', and 'Billing Inquiry' map well to our existing insurance complaint codes. I'm working on the full mapping for T7. I suggest adding a sub-tag for 'Urgent' under 'Product Issue' for things that require immediate escalation.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T7"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M21",
            "speaker_id": 37334,
            "reply_to": "M19",
            "text": "The draft looks like a good starting point. For cellar visits, we often get feedback on the physical environment. Could we add a category for 'Facility/Venue Experience'? This would cover comments on cleanliness, safety, or ambiance. It's distinct from 'Service Quality' which is more about the staff interaction.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "bulb",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M22",
            "speaker_id": 480386,
            "reply_to": "M20",
            "text": "Good idea. An 'Urgent' flag is a great addition for routing. I'll add it.",
            "mentions": [
              225681
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M23",
            "speaker_id": 480386,
            "reply_to": "M21",
            "text": "I agree, 'Facility/Venue Experience' is a valuable addition. I'll add that category. Thanks.",
